id: DRAFT-libgridxc-2.1.02.0.2-fortran-l0c-shell-entry-mod-flatten
trigger_tool: conan|test|sh
phase: testing
error_signature: L0c: No test source files in test_package/|no_test_sources|Cannot parse module file for module 'gridxc'|gridxc\.mod.*was not found
severity: 3
category: testing, build-system, cmake, ohos
match_keywords: l0c, no_test_sources, fortran, test.sh, gridxc.mod
title: 纯Fortran包因L0c后缀白名单报no_test_sources时补充Shell消费者入口并打平.mod
root_cause: ci/conan/build_and_test.sh的L0c仅find统计.c/.cpp/.cc/.cxx/.sh/.py致纯.f90包误报no_test_sources；叠加上游将.mod装入include/libgridxc编译器版本子目录而CMakeDeps仅-I include致gridxc.mod not found
affected_scope: 纯Fortran(.f90)包test_package仅含lda_contract.f90/gga_contract.f90而无C系或Shell入口且上游将.mod装入编译器版本子目录的OHOS适配包
affected_scope: 纯Fortran(.f90)包test_package仅含lda_contract.f90/gga_contract.f90而无C系或Shell入口且上游将.mod装入编译器版本子目录的OHOS适配包
verification_cmd: 本地模拟L0c/L0d/L0e检查通过且conanfile语法解析通过；真机预检test_package经sh执行test.sh断言GRIDXC_TEST PASS且不再报gridxc.mod缺失
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: add-shell-consumer-entry-and-flatten-mod
rec_description: 新增test_package/test.sh真实运行lda_contract与gga_contract并断言PASS标记由conanfile test()签名后经self.run调用；主配方package()将include树下全部.mod复制打平到include根并保留版本子目录
rec_command: test_package/test.sh新增并由conanfile.py exports_sources与test() self.run调用；test_package/MANIFEST.yml同步command；conanfile.py package()新增_flatten_fortran_modules复制*.mod到include/
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: explicit-module-include-dir
fallback_description: 若不允许打平则在cpp_info.includedirs追加include/libgridxc编译器版本子目录并显式透传Fortran模块搜索路径，保留test.sh真实执行口径不变
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: no_test_sources|gridxc\.mod.*was not found|Cannot parse module file for module 'gridxc'
forbid_1_reason: 禁止占位Shell或仅过L0c而不打平.mod；test.sh须真实执行并断言输出且.mod须在include根可见
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检仍报L0c no_test_sources或Fortran编译报gridxc.mod缺失，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-generic-tmp-readonly, DRAFT-generic-autotools-no-check, DRAFT-generic-ice-toolchain, DRAFT-generic-poetry-layout]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libgridxc-2.1.02.0.2-fortran-l0c-shell-entry-mod-flatten.md
last_updated: 2026-09-23
source_event: libgridxc/2.1.02.0.2 真机预检L0c误报与gridxc.mod缺失修复为test.sh入口与打平
authors: hmbs-executor
